  "changes": [
    "Plain ROM-only file adapter in core/Rom.cpp; ZIP and GSF loading excluded.",
    "Boost sinc helper replaced with equivalent std::sin(x)/x including near-zero Taylor expansion.",
    "NXT sample/tick loop diagnostics and bounded command budget added to sequence/core track context.",
    "Unsupported sequence opcode and reported instrument errors fail export instead of silently dropping a track.",
    "Standalone WAV renderer and OGG export orchestration outside engine.",
    "Uninitialized running status fails visibly; release extraction validates all 3124 track entrypoints.",
